  "title": "Creamy Tater Tot Casserole",
  "description": "Tater tot potatoes baked with cream of chicken soup, onion, sour cream, and sharp Cheddar cheese, topped with buttery corn flakes.",
  "authors": [
    "Bea Gassman"
  ],
